{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "03OF", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$U$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}/U$", "MATH_0005": "$U$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{C}/U$", "MATH_0008": "$V/U$", "MATH_0009": "$\\{V_i/U \\to V/U\\}$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{C}/U$", "MATH_0011": "$\\{V_i \\to V\\}$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0014": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0015": "$\\mathcal{F}|_{\\mathcal{C}/U}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{sites-modules-section-local}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{categories-example-category-over-X}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{sites-section-localize}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:319cde0c97a958e2b66df9aac1907f30d3ff017e3b313f2ec32df784d4dabc8f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:41d638c32bc9eef14366b0932526c1560e4969085556c55f29a2c39630432f8a", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThere is an abstract notion of a quasi-coherent sheaf on a ringed site.\nWe briefly introduce this here. For more information please consult\nModules on Sites, Section <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0001> be a category, and let <MATH_0002> be an object of <MATH_0003>.\nThen <MATH_0004> indicates the category of objects over <MATH_0005>, see\nCategories, Example <REF_0002>.\nIf <MATH_0006> is a site, then <MATH_0007> is a site as well, namely\nthe coverings of <MATH_0008> are families <MATH_0009> of morphisms\nof <MATH_0010> with fixed target such that\n<MATH_0011> is a covering of <MATH_0012>. Moreover, given any\nsheaf <MATH_0013> on <MATH_0014> the <TEXTITOPEN_0001>restriction<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\n<MATH_0015> (defined in the obvious manner)\nis a sheaf as well. See\nSites, Section <REF_0003>\nfor details.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c6ffcacfef5f316a5dee14d7fe95994733f7bb0a1d8add21ca7fed95c75d2657", "unit_id": "tag:03OF:prose-0002"}
